==History==
2016
*The Valkyrie [[Cards|card]] was added with Clash Royale's game launch on 4/1/2016.
*On 9/2/2016, the [[Version History#Chest Rewards & Card Balance (9/2/2016)|Chest Reward & Card Balance Update]], decreased the Valkyrie's attack time interval to 1.5 seconds (from 1.6 seconds).
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]], changed the Valkyrie so that it would no longer stop her attack if her target dies during the attack animation. It also decreased the Valkyrie's sight range to 5.5 tiles (from 6 tiles).
*On 23/3/2016, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(23/3/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Valkyrie's hitpoints and damage by 10%.
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], increased the {{Rarity|Rare}} [[Cards|card]] Level cap to 11 (from 10) and also made the Valkyrie affected by all forms of pushback. The update also fixed the “range bug”, which decreased the Valkyrie's range to 1 tile (from 1.5 tiles), but her effective range was unchanged.
2017
*On 9/10/2017, the [[Version History#Epic Quests Update (9/10/2017)|Epic Quests Update]], increased the Valkyrie's damage by 5%.
2018
*On 12/2/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (12/2/2018)|Balance Update]], decreased the Valkyrie's attack time interval to 1.4 seconds (from 1.5 seconds).
*On 4/6/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/6/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the Valkyrie‘s hitpoints by 7% and made her first attack instant (from 0.2 seconds).
*On 20/6/2018, the [[Version History#Summer%202018%20Update%20(20/6/2018)|Summer 2018 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Valkyrie from Goblin Stadium to Bone Pit.
*On 3/9/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/9/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the Valkyrie's attack time interval to 1.6 seconds (from 1.4 seconds), and added a 0.2 second delay in her first attack.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Rare}} cards start at Level 3 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 11).
2019
*On 7/1/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/1/2019)|Balance Update]], decreased the Valkyrie's attack time interval to 1.5 seconds (from 1.6 seconds), and decreased her first attack time interval to 0.1 seconds (from 0.2 seconds).
*On 1/7/2019, the [[Version History#July%202019%20Update%20(1/7/2019)|July 2019 Update]], increased the Valkyrie's range to 1.2 tiles (from 1 tile), now classified as Melee: Medium, and increased her area radius to 2.4 tiles (from 2 tiles).
*On 5/8/2019, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (5/8/2019)|Balance Update]], decreased the Valkyrie's area radius to 1.9 tiles (from 2.4 tiles). This was to fix a bug where the Valkyrie's attack was able to reach Melee: Long troops.
*On 30/9/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20September%202019%20Update%20(30/9/2019)|End of September 2019 Update]], increased the Valkyrie's area radius to 2 tiles (from 1.9 tiles). This change was not mentioned in any change notes.
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the Valkyrie's card info screen.
2021
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], changed the Valkyrie's card render.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 30/3/2022, the [[Version History#Miner Update (30/3/2022)|Miner Update]], changed the Valkyrie's card image.
*On 4/4/2022, the [[Version History#April%202022%20Update%20(4/4/2022)|April 2022 Update]], decreased the Valkyrie's hitpoints by 4%.
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], added the No Escape [[Card Mastery]] task for the Valkyrie.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2024
*On 1/1/2024, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (1/1/2024)|January 2024 Update]], added the Valkyrie's Evolution.
2025
*On 31/3/2024, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Valkyrie's hitpoints by 0.05% and her damage by 0.45%.
* [[2026|On 3/8/26 the [https://supercell.com/en/games/clashroyale/blog/news/new-season-k-h-a-o-s/ k.h.a.o.s] update added the Hero Valkyrie. 

