==Trivia==
*In Norse mythology, [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Valkyrie valkyries] collect spirits of the dead to take to [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Valhalla Valhalla], one of the Norse afterlives. Most depictions show them riding on horseback or may have wings, however, in Clash Royale, they do not ride horses or fly and instead travel on foot.
*The Valkyrie is 1 of 19 [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] which first existed in Clash of Clans, the others being [[Minions]], [[Archers]], [[Goblins]], [[Skeletons]], [[Barbarians]], [[Giant]], [[Wizard]], [[Hog Rider]], [[Witch]], [[P.E.K.K.A.]], [[Balloon]], [[Golem]], [[Wall Breakers]], [[Bowler]], [[Cannon Cart]], [[Phoenix]], [[Lava Hound]], and the [[Archer Queen]].
**The Valkyrie resembles the [https://clashofclans.fandom.com/wiki/Valkyrie Level 5 Valkyrie] from Clash of Clans.
**Before 7/6/2021, the Valkyrie's [[Cards|card]] render was taken from her Clash of Clans counterpart's render.
**The sound effects of the Valkyrie in Clash of Clans were taken from her Clash Royale counterpart.
***When attacking, the Valkyrie sings opera, which is a reference to the opera called [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Die_Walk%C3%BCre Die Walküre (The Valkyrie)] by [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Richard_Wagner Richard Wagner].
**In Clash of Clans, Valkyrie's movement speed is high whereas in Clash Royale, her movement speed is moderate.
*The Valkyrie is tied with [[Fisherman]] for the highest first attack speed of all troops, with a first attack speed of 0.1 seconds.
*The Valkyrie is one of the first troop cards to be featured in a [[Training Camp|Trainer]]'s [[Battle Decks|deck]], alongside the Minions, Archers, Knight, [[Spear Goblins]], Goblins, [[Bomber]], Skeletons, Barbarians, [[Minion Horde]], [[Mini P.E.K.K.A.|Mini P.E.K.K.A]], [[Musketeer]], Giant, Wizard, Hog Rider, [[Baby Dragon]], [[Skeleton Army]], Witch, P.E.K.K.A, [[Prince]], and Balloon.
*The Valkyrie is one of the first troop cards to receive a card render, alongside the Archers, Knight, Goblins, Bomber, Skeletons, Barbarians, [[Bats]], [[Royal Recruits]], [[Skeleton Barrel]], [[Rascals]], Musketeer, Giant, Wizard, [[Flying Machine]], Hog Rider, [[Royal Hogs]], [[Dart Goblin]], [[Zappies]], [[Elixir Golem]], Baby Dragon, Skeleton Army, Witch, P.E.K.K.A, Prince, Balloon, [[Giant Skeleton]], [[Goblin Giant]], [[Hunter]], [[Electro Dragon]], Wall Breakers, Bowler, Cannon Cart, [[Mega Knight]], [[Ram Rider]], [[Miner]], [[Royal Ghost]], [[Ice Wizard]], [[Magic Archer]], [[Bandit]], Lava Hound, [[Night Witch]], and Fisherman.
*The Valkyrie is featured as a [https://clashofclans.fandom.com/wiki/Hero_Skins?file=Valkyrie_Queen_info.png skin for Archer Queen in Clash of Clans].
*The Valkyrie, along with the Goblins, Barbarians, Giant, Wizard, Hog Rider, Witch, P.E.K.K.A, and the Archer Queen, were featured as a non-playable opponent in [https://www.chess.com/ Chess].
*The Valkyrie is the subject of 2 [[Emotes]].
*The Valkyrie was featured in the winning deck of the [https://www.youtube.com/live/nMANpDweTA4?si=nsUAou7ny3WAA2ve Clash Royale League 2022 Tournament], by a player called Mohamed Light.
*Before the Valkyrie's card release, the Valkyrie' hitpoints were increased by 14%, and her attack time interval was increased to 1.5 seconds (from 1.4 seconds).

